From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mostly_Harmless <geek520170@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:30:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix(xml): close the input file when no danmaku was read

readXml() returned 8 from the ENDREAD path without fclose(), leaking one
FILE (and its descriptor) every time an empty or unrecognised file was
read. Long-running callers that convert many files run out of
descriptors.
---
 src/XmlFile.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/XmlFile.c b/src/XmlFile.c
index e35aed7..1ed424c 100644
--- a/src/XmlFile.c
+++ b/src/XmlFile.c
@@ -603,6 +603,7 @@ int readXml(const char *const ipFile, DANMAKU **head, const char *mode, const fl
 ENDREAD:
     if (*head == NULL)
     {
+        fclose(ipF);
         return 8; /* 文件不能按正确格式读入 */
     }
 
